            "review_title": "Review at Dê Ngon Quán",
            "review_text": "Long Nguyen\n4 contributions\n0\nUnique Goat Restaurant…\nJan 2024 • Friends\nI have rarely seen a Goat restaurant with such a beautiful, clean and luxurious space. That's the first look, as for the food, it's really impressive 😅 Goat is not difficult to eat, still retains its characteristic flavor and is prepared extremely delicately. Particularly impressed with the Roasted Goat and Mongolian Goat Hot Pot 😊\nThe restaurant is in the Diplomatic Corps area 👍\nRead more\nShow original\nWritten January 30, 2024",
