            "review_title": "Review at Dê Ngon Quán",
            "review_text": "Chloe Hoang\n11 contributions\n0\nUnbelievably great\nJan 2024 • Family\nThe Vietnamese restaurant that I was most impressed with recently. Spacious space and beautiful restaurant. Last time I passed by I saw a sign of a Thai Chef holding a Michelin but I didn't think it would be so good. Delicious food, beautiful decoration and extremely spacious. The most stable point is probably that all goat dishes do not have a bad smell. The roast dish is delicious, the Mongolian goat hot pot is also very suitable. Will definitely come back more times.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nShow original\nWritten January 9, 2024",
